      "writtenOn": "2024-07-31T13:13:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe 64-bit BARs are always prefetchable. Put another way: non-prefetchable regions must be 32-bit, and this is a limitation of the PCI spec. And I note that we also check here that the memory type is `Memory64`.",
      "parentUuid": "6de37bc2_75b48b4c",
      "revId": "43e0d7312be2e0bab90124419c1e1dd514787fbe",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
