      "writtenOn": "2024-07-31T13:16:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually, maybe what I stated is a limitation only for devices behind bridges. So I can\u0027t say I\u0027m definitively correct, unfortunately!",
      "parentUuid": "02122043_46cbb258",
      "revId": "43e0d7312be2e0bab90124419c1e1dd514787fbe",
